cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ZPE-Mocap, please cite this repository record.
type: software
title: "ZPE-Mocap"
authors:
  - name: "Zer0pa (Pty) Ltd"
    email: architects@zer0pa.ai
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Mocap
url: https://github.com/Zer0pa/ZPE-Mocap
license: LicenseRef-Zer0pa-SAL-7.0
abstract: >-
  ZPE-Mocap is a deterministic motion fingerprinting and retrieval codec for
  skeletal motion data. It uses 8-direction dual-plane compass tokenisation
  applied to joint-angle deltas (Compass-8, dual xy/xz planes), parent-relative
  transforms, and zlib entropy coding to produce compact motion fingerprints
  suited for search, indexing, and retrieval across BVH motion archives.
keywords:
  - motion capture
  - deterministic codec
  - skeletal motion
  - motion fingerprinting
  - motion retrieval
  - compass-8
  - BVH
  - joint-angle encoding
